Speaker 1: The doctrine of the authority of Scripture refers to the belief that the Bible alone is ultimate and supreme authority.

00:01:17.670 --> 00:01:25.200
Speaker 1: The Bible alone is ultimate and supreme authority in all matters of faith, doctrine and practice.

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:43.600
Speaker 1: That the Bible alone is supreme and ultimate authority in all matters of faith, of doctrine and of practice.

00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:55.450
